  message: "Triage completed from alertmanager dead-code-maybe (634 candidates after PR #2890 BFS fix). Top linker gaps by category:\n(1) yaml/json marshal callbacks: 82 functions, 1540 LOC — YAML decoder/encoder interface dispatch\n(2) memberlist/cluster callbacks: 42 functions, 432 LOC — hashicorp/memberlist framework hooks\n(3) cobra CLI dispatch: 20 functions, 211 LOC — cobra.Command.Execute → handler\n(4) pipeline stage dispatch: 6 functions, 173 LOC — 2nd-level dispatches_to from pipeline stages\n(5) goroutine lifecycle: 5 functions, 253 LOC — go func() callees\n(6) swagger generated: 6 functions, 84 LOC — go-swagger configure* hooks\n471 uncategorized (avg 3 LOC each) are noise. Formal tracker items for gaps (1)-(3) recommended as next step — these represent the highest-value linker investments for Go repos."  # fbf9
